{
  "slug": "memory-recall",
  "title": "Memory Recall",
  "shortDescription": "Word, image and number-sequence recall exercises adapted from clinical memory tests like ISLT and ADAS-Cog word recall.",
  "longDescription": "Memory Recall is a comprehensive cognitive assessment inspired by standardized memory tests: the ISLT Shopping List Test, ADAS-Cog Word Recall, a Logical Memory story-recall test, an SKT-style speed naming and object recognition task, and a SAGE-style general cognitive screen.",
  "icon": "sparkles",
  "categoryKey": "memory",
  "engineType": "memory_exercise",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "estimatedDurationMinutes": 12,
  "access": "free",
  "sourceNote": "Ported verbatim from airostudio/Memory-Recall-Test (public/js/app.js) \u2014 a plain HTML/JS app, not a framework app, so this content is easy to miss by searching only .ts/.tsx files. All study lists, the story text, and object/emoji items are real. Two items (sage-orientation's correct day-of-week; skt-naming items' response-time scoring) depend on runtime/interaction state in the source app and are noted below rather than hard-coded. KNOWN GAP: memory_recall-type questions (islt-shopping-list, adas-word-recall, skt-object-recall) carry scoreConfig but the generic scoring engine (src/lib/scoring/engine.ts) does not yet compare a recalled[] answer against studyItems/distractorItems \u2014 these 3 questions currently score 0 at runtime. Fixing this needs studyItems/distractorItems threaded onto the real Question type (currently a seed-authoring-only field) plus a recall-accuracy scoring branch in collectImpacts(). The other 21 questions in this assessment (multiple_choice, timed_choice) score correctly.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "islt",
      "name": "ISLT Shopping List",
      "description": "International Shopping List Test \u2014 participants study a 12-item shopping list, then attempt to recognize the items from a mixed grid of targets and distractors.",
      "instructions": "You will see 12 shopping list items for 30 seconds. Study them carefully. Afterward, select the items you remember from a grid of 20 items (12 targets + 8 distractors).",
      "timeLimitSeconds": 30,
      "weight": 0.2,
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "key": "adas",
      "name": "ADAS-Cog Word Recall",
      "description": "Alzheimer's Disease Assessment Scale-Cognitive word list test \u2014 10 words are shown sequentially, then freely recalled by typing.",
      "instructions": "10 words will be displayed one at a time, 3 seconds each. After all words have been shown, type as many as you can remember, in any order.",
      "timeLimitSeconds": 30,
      "weight": 0.2,
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "key": "lm",
      "name": "Logical Memory Test",
      "description": "Wechsler-style Logical Memory subtest \u2014 a short news-style story is read, then comprehension/recall questions are answered about its details.",
      "instructions": "Read the story 'The Brave Firefighter' carefully. You have 45 seconds. Afterward, answer 5 multiple-choice questions about details from the story.",
      "timeLimitSeconds": 45,
      "weight": 0.2,
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "key": "skt",
      "name": "SKT Speed Test",
      "description": "Syndrom-Kurztest-inspired speed naming and object recognition task \u2014 8 objects are named as quickly as possible, then recognized from a mixed grid.",
      "instructions": "You will be shown 8 objects one at a time. Select the correct name for each as quickly as possible. Afterward, identify which objects you saw from a mixed grid of 14 (8 targets + 6 distractors).",
      "timeLimitSeconds": null,
      "weight": 0.2,
      "order": 4
    },
    {
      "key": "sage",
      "name": "SAGE Assessment",
      "description": "Self-Administered Gerocognitive Exam-inspired mixed cognitive screen covering orientation, calculation, pattern recognition, language, visual, reasoning, and memory items.",
      "instructions": "Answer each question by selecting one option. Includes one item testing recall of the earlier ISLT shopping list.",
      "timeLimitSeconds": null,
      "weight": 0.2,
      "order": 5
    }
  ],
